  tierReadouts:
  - TierLabel: LV1 Cover Shot
    StageRole: Quick ranged support that adds two clean bolts without blocking boss
      pressure.
    PlayerUse: Spend when the boss is open but the shield slot is not needed yet.
    SummonRead: BacklineShooter enters left of the player lane, advances toward the
      boss lane, and fires a narrow cover pair.
  - TierLabel: LV2 Focus Volley
    StageRole: Mid-tier support that pressures the boss lane with a wider three-shot
      answer.
    PlayerUse: Hold EN when you can stay forward long enough for a stronger punish.
    SummonRead: BacklineShooter keeps a side-lane advance toward the boss and fires
      a three-bolt focused volley.
  - TierLabel: LV3 Marksman Burst
    StageRole: High-tier ranged support for a clear boss punish window after surviving
      pressure.
    PlayerUse: Use when the next exchange should convert defense into visible boss
      damage.
    SummonRead: BacklineShooter stays alive long enough to send repeated four-bolt
      volleys across the contested lane.
